{'symbol': 'HRL', 'date': '2022-10-12 17:00:00', 'title': 'HORMEL FOODS APPOINTS SCOTT AAKRE AS SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT OF BRAND FUEL', 'text': "HORMEL FOODS ESTABLISHING NEW BRAND FUEL CENTER OF EXCELLENCE TO SUPPORT ICONIC AND EMERGING PORTFOLIO OF BRANDS AAKRE CONTINUES TO LEAD GLOBAL INNOVATION AND INSIGHTS AUSTIN, MINN. , OCT. 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- HORMEL FOODS CORPORATION (NYSE:\xa0HRL), A FORTUNE 500 GLOBAL BRANDED FOOD COMPANY, TODAY ANNOUNCED THE APPOINTMENT OF\xa0SCOTT AAKRE AS SENIOR VICE PRESIDENT OF BRAND FUEL, THE COMPANY'S NEWEST CENTER OF EXCELLENCE FOCUSED ON CONSUMER INSIGHTS AND INNOVATION FOR ITS PORTFOLIO OF MORE THAN 30 LEADING BRANDS."}